{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "label": "All five cutoffs: equal through exponential weighting",
  "description": "Four bucket counts, blend exponents 0/2/4/6, and power quality influence 1/3, with existing three-cutoff blends at pixel cutoff 0% and 50% as controls. All five-level candidates use hard admissions 0/25/50/75/90%, normalized exp(exponent * cutoff / 0.9) weights, and the complete 545-asset corpus. No image extraction or index changes. Existing single-observer development judgments only; not a held-out relevance study. All ranking is in OpenSearch. Small-corpus latency does not establish million-record scalability.",
